13
00:06:46.000 --> 00:07:14.000
These are people who don't remember the original troubles, because the troubles, the name was used to refer to the earlier conflict. They don't remember the troubles of the 1910s and 1920s. Somebody like Austin Curry, they've got TVs, they've seen the American Civil Rights Movement, they've seen Martin Luther King, marching in Selma and Montgomery, all these places. and they're impatient to see change and they're keen to learn from the American civil rights activists. Example.

