communists and there are IRA men, including the commander of the IRA's Belfast Brigade. I mean, this isn't just me making this up. There's a brilliant book on all this by Richard English. with a definitive history of the IRA called Armed Struggle. Right, Richard English. Yeah, I know, he's got very unfortunate. He would say that, wouldn't he? I know, mental. He's a Northern Irish historian called Richard English

