00:12:46.000 --> 00:13:07.000
Isn't that history all the time? Yeah. History is a land of contrast. The civil rights movement might have in some ways started as an IRA front, but it has become something much bigger. and much broader. And actually the real tragedy of the civil rights movement really is its timing. Because as we said, it's modelled on the American Civil Rights Movement.

