00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:35.000
And this is one reason why I said we'd come back to this issue about second-class citizens. It's why it's very hard for a lot of unionists to accept the second-class citizen criticism. So there's a great book called Loyalists by Peter Taylor. Peter Taylor, BBC journalist, did three books called Provo's Brits Loyalists, basically oral histories, lots of interviews, looking at the conflict through three different lenses. And this is one on loyalists. It's full of interviews with poor, working-class Protestants,

