00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:31.000
you have the whip hand over in your neighbours. They're offended by this because they don't feel that way at all. And so, of course, the tragedy in some ways, the tragic irony of the civil rights movement is that it actually inadvertently, through no fault of their own in many ways, drives people like this into the arms of Ian Paisley and away from the centre ground and away from Terrence O'Neill because there was never any opportunity that they could have signed up with housing activists

