system. You can't just give us this. But on the other side, some of O'Neill's own ministers say, God, you're a total wuss and appeaser. You go over to London, you let them push you around, tell us what to do in our own country. It says, well, Paisley was obviously right about you. You know, you're just a weakling. You don't stand up for Ulster. You're just too interested in pleasing the English. You know, you're basically in an Englishman anyway with your Eaton background.

