01:15:16.000 --> 01:15:57.000
And people will be stunned to hear that Ted Heath's government is preparing to take a truly disastrous gamble. What are the odds on that? And then in our final episode, the bloody steer of the troubles, which is 1972, Bloody Sunday in Derry, Bloody Friday in Belfast, and one last chance for peace. So club members, of course, can hear those two episodes right now. And if you're not a member, you can join them on the rest is history.com. And members also receive our brilliant newsletter full of amazing features, quizzes, competitions, just unbelievable value.

